== Walkthrough ==

Grevak doesn't like lizards.  You can give Grevak in the Greenblood guild four [[Lizard Tail]]s for a minor item.

You say, 'Hail, Grevak'

: Grevak says 'Need new members we do not. Powerful enough we are with Grevak. Still, peons needed. Are you a [new peon] or are you an [outsider]? Speak up!! Fool!! No time Grevak has!!'

You say, 'I am a new peon'

: Grevak says 'So you think you can be greater than Grevak!! Touch you not and still I can smash you. I am a Greenblood shadowknight!! Peon go to swamps and slay lizardmen. You return with four lizardmen tails and a reward is yours. You return with two lizardman shaman dolls and a great reward is yours.'

'''You hand the four lizardmen tails to Grevak:'''

: Grevak says 'Hmph! You still not as great as Grevak!! But you do gud. Here.'

<div class="facblock">
* Your faction standing with [[Clurg]] got better.
* Your faction standing with [[Green Blood Knights]] got better.
* Your faction standing with [[Kazon Stormhammer]] got worse.
* Your faction standing with [[Shadowknights of Night Keep]] got worse.
</div>

